</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Full-width half-maximum (FWHM) (s)</td><td align="left">The width of the waveform shape at half (50%) of its maximum amplitude</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Relative FWHM (no unit)</td><td align="left">
<inline-formula id="IEq10"><alternatives><tex-math id="M17">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
