</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Ratio of the full-width at 75% of the peak to the full-width at 50% of the peak (FWQ3_to_FWHM) (no unit)</td><td align="left">
<inline-formula id="IEq11"><alternatives><tex-math id="M19">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
